 Marketing Funnel & Conversion Performance Analysis

📌 Project Overview

This project analyzes bank marketing campaign data using Microsoft Power BI to understand customer responses, subscription outcomes, and conversion performance.

The goal is to identify conversion patterns, evaluate contact channels, and recommend ways to improve future marketing campaigns.

🎯 Project Objectives

- Analyze overall marketing campaign performance.
- Measure customer subscription and conversion rates.
- Compare conversion performance across contact types.
- Explore successful subscriptions by job and education.
- Identify opportunities to improve customer targeting.

🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Microsoft Power BI
- DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)
- Data Visualization
- Marketing Campaign Analysis

