🔍 Key Insights

- A total of 4,521 customer records were analyzed.
- 521 customers subscribed successfully, resulting in an overall conversion rate of 11.52%.
- 4,000 customers did not subscribe, highlighting an opportunity to improve campaign effectiveness.
- Conversion rates varied across contact types.
- Customer and campaign characteristics can help guide future marketing strategies.

💡 Recommendations

- Evaluate contact channels based on their observed conversion performance.
- Identify customer segments with stronger subscription rates.
- Review call duration and campaign frequency alongside subscription outcomes.
- Refine future campaigns using insights from customer response patterns.

